          <body>**CDIF**

Definition
==========

Profile module for SKOS concept schemes used as controlled vocabularies in CDIF metadata. Thin wrapper around skosConceptScheme.
:title: "CDIF Concept Scheme"
:idDescription: "URI identifier for this concept scheme."
:rdfType: ``skos:ConceptScheme``
:contextSchema: {"description": "JSON-LD context declaring the skos namespace prefix and any additional prefixes used in concept URIs. May be a single object or an array of strings and objects.", "type": "object", "properties": {"skos": {"const": "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#"}}, "required": ["skos"]}</body>
          <annotatedElement xmi:idref="cdif.bbr.metadata.profiles.cdifProfile.cdifConceptScheme.ConceptScheme"/>
        </ownedComment>
